# WarpOne regression list — one test entry per line; `make regress` runs these.
# Format (Phase 1+):  <suite>/<test_name>   # description
# Empty in Phase 0; populated as directed/compliance/lockstep tests are written.
#
# Planned suites:
#   compliance/*   directed ISA compliance programs with expected traces (Phase 1)
#   directed/*     divergence depths 0-4, all-lanes-inactive, stack over/underflow,
#                  barrier deadlock, every bank-conflict pattern (Phase 2/5)
#   lockstep/*     RTL-vs-sim retired-state comparison kernels (Phase 2)
